@startuml uml-booking-state
!theme plain
title ParkEase BD: UML State Machine Diagram (Booking)

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
  BorderColor #E65100
}

[*] --> PAYMENT_PENDING : User creates booking\nfrom a 5-minute hold

PAYMENT_PENDING --> CONFIRMED : payment validated by SSLCOMMERZ\n(or paid fully from Refund Balance)\n/ issue QR access credential
PAYMENT_PENDING --> EXPIRED : hold runs out unpaid
PAYMENT_PENDING --> CANCELLED : User cancels before paying

CONFIRMED --> CHECKED_IN : Guard verifies the QR credential\nand confirms check-in\n(from 1 hour before start)
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : User or Admin cancels\n/ refund by cancellation policy
CONFIRMED --> NO_SHOW : scheduled end time passes\nwithout check-in\n/ settle, return deposit

CHECKED_IN --> CHECKOUT_REQUESTED : User requests checkout\n(optional; alerts the Guard)
CHECKED_IN --> COMPLETED : Guard confirms exit,\novertime covered / settle
CHECKOUT_REQUESTED --> COMPLETED : Guard confirms exit,\novertime covered by deposit\nand Refund Balance / settle
CHECKOUT_REQUESTED --> PAYMENT_DUE : Guard confirms exit,\novertime exceeds deposit\nand Refund Balance
CHECKED_IN --> PAYMENT_DUE : Guard confirms exit,\novertime not covered
PAYMENT_DUE --> COMPLETED : User pays the outstanding\namount / settle

CONFIRMED --> DISPUTED : User or Provider\nopens a dispute
CHECKED_IN --> DISPUTED : dispute opened
COMPLETED --> DISPUTED : dispute opened
DISPUTED --> [*] : Admin resolves or rejects\nthe dispute (outcome kept\non the Dispute record)

COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
NO_SHOW --> [*]

note right of COMPLETED
  Settlement moves the Provider's share
  from pending to available balance,
  recognizes the platform fee as
  platform revenue, and returns any
  unused deposit to the User's
  Refund Balance.
end note

@enduml
